194
00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:54.250
After signing in again, I create the two
folders and set them in Hyper-V Settings,

195
00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.500
along with Enhanced Session Mode.

196
00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:01.550
In Virtual Switch Manager I create
External on the Ethernet adapter, then

197
00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:03.000
Internal and Private.

198
00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.450
Notice that 192.

199
00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.900
168.

200
00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.350
50.

201
00:12:07.600 --> 00:12:09.600
30 moved to vEthernet External.

202
00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:13.050
Finally, I give vEthernet Internal the
address 10.

203
00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.500
10.

204
00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:15.950
10.

205
00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.400
1.

206
00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:23.250
Hyper-V is a type 1 hypervisor, with a
root partition, child partitions, and the

207
00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:24.700
VMBus between them.

208
00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:30.950
The host needs SLAT, Intel VT or AMD-V
